refactor(state_drain): extract halt() helper shared by drain paths

The Debug-Module halt-and-wait prologue (write dmactive, then dmactive|haltreq,
then poll for allhalted) was open-coded in drain(). Extract it to a private
halt(ctx) helper so the upcoming counters-only drain can reuse it instead of
copying the three lines. Structural change only -- no behavior change; the poll
label stays parameterized to preserve the existing message.

